# Local-development SQLite location (PLAN.md §4, §11).
#
# When the backend runs directly on the host, DB_PATH defaults to
# db/finally.db and the file lands here. Under Docker the database lives at
# /app/db inside the container, backed by the named volume `finally-data` —
# nothing appears in this directory in that case.
#
# This file only keeps the directory present in the repo. The .db files are
# gitignored.
